# Where the contact form posts (JSON). Leave empty to fall back to a mailto: link.
# Works with any form backend that accepts a JSON POST, for example:
#   Formspree        https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxxxx
#   Web3Forms        https://api.web3forms.com/submit   (add the access key to the form)
#   Netlify Forms    /  (enable in netlify.toml and keep the hidden form-name field)
#   Your own server  https://api.example.com/enquiry
PUBLIC_FORM_ENDPOINT=
